            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitwanikini ijo, ŋes atwanikini eoŋ, ŋes kedaikinio da; keswamak EJAKAIT eoŋ kwaŋin ka adepar da, arai ca kitiaki akirot kere jo keoŋ dimarai atwanare.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.17",
